 & =(2(-3)-1)\\,i+(2(8)+12(-3))\\,j \\\\  & =-7\\,i-20\\,j \\\\  & =⟨-7,-20⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n Hence, $∇f(8,-3)=⟨-7,-20⟩$ is a normal vector to the curve at $(8,-3).$\n\nFinally, the Cartesian equation of the line that is parallel to $v=⟨{v}_{x},{v}_{y}⟩$ and passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x-{x}_{0}}{{v}_{x}} & =\\frac{y-{y}_{0}}{{v}_{y}} \\\\ \\frac{x-8}{-7} & =\\frac{y-(-3)}{-20} \\\\ -20(x-8) & =-7(y+3) \\\\ -20x+7y+160+21 & =0 \\\\ -20x+7y+181 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322851 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322852 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322853 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322854 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1000 #edb/ref 17592186322855 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1041 "selection" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1104 #edb/ref 17592186322855 13194139534962 true] [17592186322850 1110 #uuid "aec70da3-a71a-537a-8116-95cc5283e8dd" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322851 1034 "-20x-7y+181=0" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322851 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534962 true] [17592186322851 1111 #uuid "1ef299fd-3808-54bd-9ffb-077cd2b50837" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322852 1034 "-20x+7y+28=0" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322852 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534962 true] [17592186322852 1111 #uuid "a78db14b-f527-5d32-9140-a7d7fd3a0a19" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322853 1034 "20x+7y+181=0" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322853 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534962 true] [17592186322853 1111 #uuid "c9297e72-1bc1-576b-a092-063e0274183a" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322854 1034 "20x+7y-139=0" 13194139534962 true] [17592186322854 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534962 true] [17592186322854 1111 #uuid "20a6c3bd-a054-53bd-9821-f41e7a506721" 131941395349